Caller-process gap (not a kernel defect, unchanged): renlink advanced stages in the room without
calling `gate evaluate` / `goal tick` / `receive-result`, so its run stayed at plan. The kernel now
records whatever is actually done; it still cannot invent a stage that was never ticked.

